   "claims": [
    "How to calculate cubic yards To calculate cubic yards we use the following formula: Cubic yards = Length (ft) x Width (ft) x Depth (ft) ÷ 27 This formula does, of course, assume you've measured the depth in feet.",
    "Multiply your area figure (from step 1) by your depth figure (from step 3) to get cubic feet.",
    "Divide your cubic feet figure by 27 to get cubic yards.",
    "This means our measurements are: Width: 10 feet Length: 15 feet Depth: 0.5 feet To calculate cubic yards, we multiply 10 × 15 × 0.5 to get a total of 75 cubic feet.",
    "We then divide by 27 to get 2.78 cubic yards.",
    "Divide your result by 27 to get your cubic yards measurement."
   ],
