    "To derive this answer, you need to: Recall the conversion factor: one cubic yard is 27 cubic feet.",
    "Multiply 2 cubic yards by the conversion factor: 2 × 27 = 54.",
    "Remember to include the unit: the answer is 54 cubic feet."
